# ==============================================================================
# TerraVista — Environment Variables Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE FOR EVALUATOR / PROFESSOR:
# TerraVista is designed to be 100% runnable OUT OF THE BOX without setting any
# environment variables or creating external database accounts.
#
# If you wish to connect Supabase in the future, copy this file to `.env.local`
# and fill in the optional keys below. Otherwise, the app gracefully falls back
# to the verified local curated dataset in `src/data/destinations.ts`.
# ==============================================================================

# (OPTIONAL) Supabase Integration:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# (OPTIONAL) Node Environment (defaults to development or production automatically):
# NODE_ENV=development
